<i>Grandma. I found a big river snail.</i>

384
00:30:27,519 --> 00:30:28,599
<i>So big!</i>

385
00:30:28,599 --> 00:30:31,599
<i>That's amazing.</i>

386
00:30:33,920 --> 00:30:35,400
<i>Let's go look over there.</i>

387
00:30:35,400 --> 00:30:37,752
<i>They are there, too, right?</i>

388
00:30:53,440 --> 00:30:55,119
Grandma.

389
00:30:55,119 --> 00:30:58,079
Xuan Island is almost done.

390
00:30:58,079 --> 00:31:00,359
When you get better,

391
00:31:00,359 --> 00:31:02,759
