392
00:31:03,680 --> 00:31:05,319
You wanted to

393
00:31:05,319 --> 00:31:08,359
worship Mazu and the Dragon King,

394
00:31:08,359 --> 00:31:10,200
and watch the sunset, didn't you?

395
00:31:10,200 --> 00:31:12,039
Look.

396
00:31:12,039 --> 00:31:14,079
The sunset.

397
00:31:14,079 --> 00:31:15,839
How beautiful it is.

398
00:31:17,359 --> 00:31:18,960
By then,

399
00:31:18,960 --> 00:31:21,720
we can enjoy life together.

400
00:31:23,559 --> 00:31:25,960
I've already enjoyed

401
00:31:25,960 --> 00:31:28,640
a lot of good fortune in my life.

402
00:31:30,599 --> 00:31:31,680
We may not be

403
00:31:31,680 --> 00:31:34,599
related by blood,

404
00:31:38,440 --> 00:31:40,640
but having a daughter

405
00:31:40,640 --> 00:31:43,000
and a grandson like you,

406
00:31:44,240 --> 00:31:46,554
I have no regrets.

407
00:32:16,079 --> 00:32:17,680
Grandma?

408
00:32:21,200 --> 00:32:22,880
Grandma.

409
00:34:14,174 --> 00:34:15,199
[Zhou Gui Mei, Beloved Grandmother]

410
00:34:15,199 --> 00:34:16,800
Grandma.

411
00:34:18,320 --> 00:34:20,760
I brought you here to see the sea.

412
00:34:28,119 --> 00:34:29,800
I know

413
00:34:31,360 --> 00:34:33,679
I'm not your biological grandson.

414
00:34:34,719 --> 00:34:36,719
Everyone here

415
00:34:36,719 --> 00:34:40,039
only knows you as an old lady
who loved handicrafts.

416
00:34:40,760 --> 00:34:42,039
But I know,

417
00:34:42,039 --> 00:34:44,360
when you were young,

418
00:34:44,360 --> 00:34:46,239
you went to school.

419
00:34:46,960 --> 00:34:49,800
You had a hard life.

420
00:34:49,800 --> 00:34:51,800
Your husband died young,

421
00:34:51,800 --> 00:34:53,400
and you raised Xing Guo Dong

422
00:34:53,400 --> 00:34:55,239
all by yourself.

423
00:34:55,239 --> 00:34:56,719
To make a living,

424
00:34:56,719 --> 00:34:58,440
you farmed,

425
00:34:58,440 --> 00:35:00,159
worked as a fisherwoman.

426
00:35:00,159 --> 00:35:02,440
You even became a sailor.

427
00:35:02,440 --> 00:35:04,719
You endured so much hardship.

428
00:35:05,519 --> 00:35:08,199
Even though we aren't related by blood,

429
00:35:08,199 --> 00:35:09,840
and you knew

430
00:35:09,840 --> 00:35:12,320
I wasn't your real grandson,

431
00:35:12,320 --> 00:35:13,880
you loved me

432
00:35:13,880 --> 00:35:16,000
love than anyone else.

433
00:35:17,119 --> 00:35:19,440
Ever since I can remember,

434
00:35:20,039 --> 00:35:23,320
I've seen you as my own grandma.

435
00:35:23,320 --> 00:35:25,440
My dearest, closest grandma.

436
00:35:25,440 --> 00:35:27,519
You are more than that: you're my savior.

437
00:35:31,159 --> 00:35:33,880
Every time I was in despair,

438
00:35:33,880 --> 00:35:36,679
you were always by my side,

439
00:35:37,880 --> 00:35:40,360
pulling me back

440
00:35:40,360 --> 00:35:42,159
from the edge.

441
00:35:43,280 --> 00:35:44,800
When I was little,

442
00:35:44,800 --> 00:35:46,360
I once

443
00:35:46,360 --> 00:35:48,320
secretly bought some candy.

444
00:35:48,320 --> 00:35:50,840
Xing Guo Dong kicked me to the ground.

445
00:35:51,559 --> 00:35:53,679
I lay there, crying.

446
00:35:54,594 --> 00:35:56,440
You were the one

447
00:35:56,440 --> 00:35:58,719
who picked me up,

448
00:35:58,719 --> 00:36:00,440
comforted me, and said,

449
00:36:00,440 --> 00:36:02,519
"There, there,

450
00:36:02,519 --> 00:36:04,000
Wu.

451
00:36:04,000 --> 00:36:05,719
You're okay.

452
00:36:06,840 --> 00:36:08,760
Eat the candy,

453
00:36:09,360 --> 00:36:11,280
and the bitterness will go away."

454
00:36:12,199 --> 00:36:14,639
When I was little,

455
00:36:15,360 --> 00:36:17,719
I got very sick.

456
00:36:18,280 --> 00:36:21,468
I had to go to the hospital every day.

457
00:36:22,159 --> 00:36:24,440
Xing Guo Dong said it was a waste of money.

458
00:36:25,800 --> 00:36:27,519
Only you stood out.

459
00:36:27,519 --> 00:36:30,079
You wouldn't spend money on the bus,

460
00:36:33,159 --> 00:36:35,119
so you carried me on your back.

461
00:36:35,119 --> 00:36:37,760
It was over ten kilometers to the county.

462
00:36:37,760 --> 00:36:40,320
Every day you carried me there and back.

463
00:36:40,320 --> 00:36:42,519
But what about yourself?

464
00:36:42,519 --> 00:36:44,320
When you got sick,

465
00:36:44,320 --> 00:36:45,920
you wouldn't get treated.

466
00:36:45,920 --> 00:36:47,280
Even with a fracture,

467
00:36:47,280 --> 00:36:49,840
you wouldn't get surgery.

468
00:36:49,840 --> 00:36:51,960
As time goes by, your legs gave out,

469
00:36:51,960 --> 00:36:54,400
you wouldn't buy a wheelchair.

470
00:36:54,400 --> 00:36:57,159
So I said, "Fine, I'll make you one."

471
00:36:57,159 --> 00:36:58,795
I made you a wheelchair

472
00:36:58,795 --> 00:37:00,400
out of a chair and some wheels,

473
00:37:00,400 --> 00:37:03,079
but you could tell

474
00:37:03,079 --> 00:37:04,400
it wasn't as good as

475
00:37:04,400 --> 00:37:06,991
a real one.

476
00:37:07,840 --> 00:37:10,800
Last time I bought you a electric wheelchair.

477
00:37:10,800 --> 00:37:12,760
You said

478
00:37:12,760 --> 00:37:15,624
I was wasting money.

479
00:37:16,519 --> 00:37:19,519
But you looked so happy sitting on it.

480
00:37:22,719 --> 00:37:25,239
Then, I realized that

481
00:37:25,239 --> 00:37:28,000
you wanted to go out and explore, too.

482
00:37:30,920 --> 00:37:32,599
Grandma,

483
00:37:34,800 --> 00:37:36,760
you always said,

484
00:37:38,680 --> 00:37:41,118
"Let's go beachcombing."

485
00:37:42,119 --> 00:37:44,440
"Let's go see the sea."

486
00:37:44,440 --> 00:37:47,440
"Let's go fulfill our vows."

487
00:37:47,440 --> 00:37:49,159
"Let's go worship Mazu and

488
00:37:49,159 --> 00:37:50,280
the Dragon King."

489
00:37:50,280 --> 00:37:52,599
"Let's go watch the sunset."

490
00:37:52,599 --> 00:37:54,332
But after that day,

491
00:37:59,039 --> 00:38:01,519
you never went out again.

492
00:38:09,159 --> 00:38:10,840
Grandma,

493
00:38:12,239 --> 00:38:14,159
in the next life,

494
00:38:16,000 --> 00:38:18,574
I still want to be your grandson.

495
00:38:20,559 --> 00:38:22,320
In the next life,

496
00:38:23,800 --> 00:38:26,320
I'll still be your Wu.

497
00:38:29,679 --> 00:38:32,080
I won't

498
00:38:32,080 --> 00:38:35,053
let you suffer so much ever again.

499
00:39:06,719 --> 00:39:07,760
<i>You look gorgeous.</i>

500
00:39:07,760 --> 00:39:09,199
<i>Really.</i>

501
00:39:09,199 --> 00:39:11,358
<i>I've got the touch.</i>

502
00:39:20,079 --> 00:39:22,599
<i>Here, take one each.</i>

503
00:39:22,599 --> 00:39:23,719
<i>Grandma,</i>

504
00:39:23,719 --> 00:39:25,800
<i>this flower bon is so pretty.</i>

505
00:39:25,800 --> 00:39:27,559
<i>Your auntie and I went to</i>

506
00:39:27,559 --> 00:39:30,079
<i>the Sea Goddess Temple to pray for these.</i>

507
00:39:30,079 --> 00:39:31,280
<i>Eat them, and you'll have</i>

508
00:39:31,280 --> 00:39:32,599
<i>sharp ears and clear eyes.</i>

509
00:39:32,599 --> 00:39:33,679
<i>You'll get great grades.</i>

510
00:39:33,679 --> 00:39:35,920
<i>- Thank you, Grandma.
- Thank you, Grandma.</i>

511
00:40:27,120 --> 00:40:29,400
Kids, do well on the exam.

512
00:40:29,400 --> 00:40:30,920
Strive for a great start

513
00:40:30,920 --> 00:40:32,880
and bring honor to Zhazhating!

514
00:40:32,880 --> 00:40:34,079
- Yes, bring honor!
- Thanks, Dad.

515
00:40:34,079 --> 00:40:35,159
Don't be nervous.

516
00:40:35,159 --> 00:40:36,519
Just take it easy.

517
00:40:36,519 --> 00:40:37,719
No pressure.

518
00:40:37,719 --> 00:40:39,519
- Just show what you've got.
- That's right.

519
00:40:39,519 --> 00:40:41,440
- Believe in yourselves.
- What does it mean?

520
00:40:41,440 --> 00:40:43,440
Mom, what's the sunflower for?

521
00:40:43,440 --> 00:40:46,199
To "sun your way to the top."

522
00:40:46,199 --> 00:40:48,629
- Right.
- Life needs a little ceremony.

523
00:40:48,629 --> 00:40:50,880
We're all wearing qipaos today.

524
00:40:50,880 --> 00:40:54,639
- To wish you victory from the start!
- To wish you victory from the start!

525
00:40:54,639 --> 00:40:55,840
It's the kids' exam,

526
00:40:55,840 --> 00:40:57,280
