527
00:40:57,280 --> 00:40:59,239
I'm nervous. Can't you tell?

528
00:40:59,239 --> 00:41:00,880
Nervous? Don't be nervous.

529
00:41:00,880 --> 00:41:01,920
Son.

530
00:41:01,920 --> 00:41:02,960
Let me tell you.

531
00:41:02,960 --> 00:41:04,119
Just take it like you always do.

532
00:41:04,119 --> 00:41:06,840
Your dad and I don't expect too much.

533
00:41:06,840 --> 00:41:09,360
Maybe I'll be a dark horse?

534
00:41:09,360 --> 00:41:10,440
- I'll give it my all.
- Oh, come on.

535
00:41:10,440 --> 00:41:13,005
Just do well. That's all.

536
00:41:13,005 --> 00:41:14,119
The bus is here.

537
00:41:14,119 --> 00:41:16,440
- Come on.
- Come on.

538
00:41:16,440 --> 00:41:20,559
- Go! Go! Go!
- Go! Go! Go!

539
00:41:20,559 --> 00:41:22,079
I didn't mean you can blow it off!

540
00:41:22,079 --> 00:41:23,280
- Do your best!
- I'm fine, really.

541
00:41:23,280 --> 00:41:25,119
- Take your time.
- Make your mom proud!

542
00:41:25,119 --> 00:41:26,360
Good luck, Wu!

543
00:41:26,360 --> 00:41:27,800
Good luck!

544
00:41:31,800 --> 00:41:33,639
Good luck!

545
00:41:33,639 --> 00:41:36,960
- Good luck!
- Good luck!

546
00:42:13,159 --> 00:42:15,679
Finished!

